ta, Wetstyle & Duravit. Fully developed lower level offers bedrooms, gym, office & impressive 4K media room with Sonos/Paradigm audio. Viessmann boiler, A/C, 2023 new Class 3 shingles, irrigation, new landscaping, cedar deck, patio & heated garage with future EV conduit. A rare marriage of authentic MCM architecture & modern luxury. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$2,100,000"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","5"],["Bathrooms","4"],["Half bathrooms","2"],["Living area","1,935 sq ft"],["Lot size","11,380 sq ft"],["Year built","1962"],["Neighbourhood","Parkview"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5R0B9"],["MLS® number","E4510127"],["Listed","September 24, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Water softener, Central Vacuum, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Microwave, Oven - Built-In, Hood Fan, Window Coverings, Garage door opener remote(s)"],["Heating","In Floor Heating"],["Cooling","Central air conditioning"],["Fireplace","Gas"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Detached Garage, Heated Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","7.53 m × 5.93 m (24'8\" × 19'5\")"],["Dining room","Main level","5.28 m × 3.64 m (17'4\" × 11'11\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","4.51 m × 3.26 m (14'10\" × 10'8\")"],["Family room","Lower level","6.80 m × 4.19 m (22'4\" × 13'9\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","4.28 m × 4.28 m (14'1\" × 14'1\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","4.10 m × 2.75 m (13'5\" × 9'0\")"],["Bedroom 3","Lower level","3.89 m × 3.77 m (12'9\" × 12'4\")"],["Bedroom 4","Lower level","4.03 m × 3.32 m (13'3\" × 10'11\")"],["Bedroom 5","Lower level","3.99 m × 3.78 m (13'1\" × 12'5\")"],["Laundry room","Lower level",""],["Office","Lower level","3.76 m × 3.68 m (12'4\" × 12'1\")"]],"courtesy":"Janice Kosak, MaxWell Challenge Realty","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"parkview","area":"west-edmonton"}